\begin{document}

\title{ReFit: To What Extent Can AI Advice Be Considered `Safe'?}

% Matches the QMUL Word template's author block exactly: a SINGLE centred
% block of four lines -- student name, student number (italic), supervisor
% name, programme of study. Not two IEEE-style co-author columns.
